      "content": "i feel like i’m disappearing. like there’s just nothing left of me. everything i do is for everyone else and i can’t even remember what it feels like to just... breathe without feeling like i’m drowning in everything i have to do. i'm just so tired of being stuck in this loop. it feels like there's no way out.",
