      "content": "It is understandable that you feel the immense pressure of this ongoing cycle, making the thought of escape seem like the only solution. That feeling of needing control when life feels chaotic is a very heavy burden to carry. Instead of seeking an end, can we focus on finding one tiny, immediate act of control for today, even if it's just five minutes for yourself? Please consider contacting the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline right now; they can help you find immediate, tangible ways to feel safer and less obligated in this moment.",
